# The PR #4 incident: two backend PRs collide, #4 goes stale, the update hits a
# content conflict, the review lane escalates across lanes to the owning team,
# the agent keeps both and the harness merges, and the blocked frontend ships.
# NEW for the flagship (2026-09-02); distinct from issue-to-merge's generic loop.
# Laid as a clockwise 3x2 U (top row L->R, drop on the right, bottom row R->L),
# same as issue-to-merge, so the fixed-width export stays short: the earlier
# single-column chain rendered 1600x3761 and dwarfed the article column.
# grid-rows:2 fills row-major, so the bottom row is DECLARED reversed
# (unblock, resolve, escalate) to put escalate under conflict for a clean drop.
grid-rows: 2
horizontal-gap: 210
vertical-gap: 120

collide: "1 · The Collision\nTwo Backend PRs Edit the Same Lines.\nSearch Merges First;\nPR #4 (Delete) Goes Stale" {
  style: {fill: "#ffffff"; stroke: "#94a3b8"; font-color: "#475569"; bold: true}
}
refused: "2 · Approved, Yet Refused\nPR #4 Is Fine on Its Merits,\nbut the Platform Will Not\nMerge a Stale Branch" {
  style: {fill: "#fee2e2"; stroke: "#dc2626"; font-color: "#7f1d1d"; bold: true}
}
conflict: "3 · The Boring Fix Fails\nUpdate the Branch Hits a\nCONTENT CONFLICT: Keeping\nBoth Is a Judgment Call" {
  style: {fill: "#fee2e2"; stroke: "#dc2626"; font-color: "#7f1d1d"; bold: true}
}
unblock: "6 · The Unblock\nThe Blocked Frontend Issue Is\nReleased and Ships; No Human\nDecision in the Whole Chain" {
  style: {fill: "#dcfce7"; stroke: "#16a34a"; font-color: "#14532d"; bold: true}
}
resolve: "5 · The Resolution\nThe Backend Agent Keeps BOTH\nFeatures, Tests 10 of 10 Green;\nthe Harness Merges #4" {
  style: {fill: "#fff7ed"; stroke: "#d97706"; font-color: "#7c2d12"; bold: true}
}
escalate: "4 · The Escalation\nHanded to the Team That Owns\nthe Code: a Resolve Job in\nthe BACKEND Namespace" {
  style: {fill: "#f5f3ff"; stroke: "#7c3aed"; font-color: "#4c1d95"; bold: true}
}

collide -> refused
refused -> conflict
conflict -> escalate: "Escalated\nAcross Lanes" {
  style: {stroke-dash: 5; stroke: "#0891b2"; font-color: "#164e63"; bold: true}
}
escalate -> resolve
resolve -> unblock: "Frees the\nBlocked Work" {
  style: {stroke-dash: 5; stroke: "#0891b2"; font-color: "#164e63"; bold: true}
}
